id: pm-memory-ci-health-skew
title: Verify clone-local extension host skew before tracker health certification
description: "An additional read-only health probe during Fleet CI v2 round 2 failed strict health with extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew for pm-github (host 2026.11.11 versus extension host 2026.11.14). It also reported three stale in-progress items as advisory. Requested typecheck, lint, focused tests, workflow/tooling tests, strict YAML and identity checks pass independently. Determine whether the extension state is clone-local and confirm fresh CI installation health before declaring tracker health certified. This follow-up does not change dependencies or installed extensions."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[3]: ci,follow-up,health
created_at: "2026-11-15T14:33:48.561Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-19T06:33:39.261Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-19T06:33:39.260Z",codex-sol,Round DJ independently reproduced strict health failure with the development host 2026.11.14 and a global pm-github activated for 2026.11.18. The same strict check with merge drivers required passed when PM_GLOBAL_PATH selected an empty scope. The existing stale in-progress warning remained advisory.
